Let me write a GraphQL query. The Linear API supports the following:

```graphql
query {
  issue(id: "MOB-42") {
    id
    title
    subIssues {
      nodes {
        id
        identifier
        title
        estimate
        dueDate
        priority
      }
    }
  }
}
```

